  "fixed_sources": [
    {
      "kind": "l2",
      "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
      "full_revision": "633bf12ea8f948db8ba3d6600179c4a9507377a7",
      "sha256": "cae0cf9f564ec607e855fcc98f934801bee1c63be4b9446f9097578748cb70f6",
      "line_pins": [
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 159,
          "literal_utf8": "接続の版契約はHARNESS-L2-010/011に沿う。接続ごとに固有のconnectorを一つ対応づける。connectorは入力・出力、契約版、依存版、観測可能な進行・結果・証拠、失敗時の戻し先、未完義務を引き継ぐ。source authorityやtarget authorityを移さず、片側の成功だけで接続成功としない。以下の機構・source群の個別connectorは互いに代用しない。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "45613621cff1a878275aa9b135e2578e804862e9272b3a7ff48b04b392b9399b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 160,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 161,
          "literal_utf8": "各接続は個別identityであり、各接続に固有のHELIX-CONNECT connectorを一つ割り当てる。各接続packは下記の入力・出力・親L1・依存・保証・失敗時戻し先を持ち、共通contractの実版記録はHARNESS-L2-010/011に従う。各節で示す`version_target`は機能目標であってartifact versionではない。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "fc35c1d78bf3deaf610b477fb6e2788a9ba554fc741a84abb7f0d814b591ec19"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 183,
          "literal_utf8": "### HELIXLABO-L2-016 — Experiment → Assurance Allocation\n",
          "raw_sha256": "3b99b6bfd73e1041b4050a9e56305b7cfed579fd1d9dcf2afbdbd35b696e12a2"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 184,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 185,
          "literal_utf8": "- 親：HELIXLABO-L1-005（Experiment）、HELIXLABO-L1-006（Assurance Allocation）。入力：比較結果・反例・oracle・中断状態。出力：system/operation評価材料。依存：L2-006。保証：比較可能性と反例を保持。判定不能はoperation候補として保留する。`version_target: 1.0`。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "eb2f15c0c1b78d73407c846a157e7b7ace0e5e88530dbf08326b8d7e204305d4"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 187,
          "literal_utf8": "### HELIXLABO-L2-017 — Assurance Allocation → Operational Fallback\n",
          "raw_sha256": "0ae2cb65a5c05caa05f18db11b495423db5d80499d655fb96423e1b767b9bbb2"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 188,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 189,
          "literal_utf8": "- 親：HELIXLABO-L1-006（Assurance Allocation／Operational Fallback）。入力：system/operation適格性と現行保証。出力：再評価候補・未完義務。依存：L2-007と現行版情報。保証：LABOは切替を実行しない。所有者の運転結果が不足すればownerへ戻す。`version_target: 1.0`。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "33cc3be6b92ad20ef52651f91bd384a87b1b213e93ebefcccf4beb2c2cc86b38"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 203,
          "literal_utf8": "### HELIXLABO-L2-021 — HELIX-HARNESS → Aggregate\n",
          "raw_sha256": "4dedccb06debf88bbc1e3e4935efd2ce77e9d69ea66759e478e8c96a4fc60727"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 204,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 205,
          "literal_utf8": "- 親：HELIXLABO-L1-001。入力：HARNESSから許可された過去工程・実績観測。出力：source identity/revision付きobservation。依存：HARNESS source contractと個別connector。保証：HARNESS authorityとraw recordを保持。data scope/版不明はHARNESS ownerへ戻す。`version_target: 1.0`。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "5008a5338cec2d9ee601fac9174753405b3e86ae49bd21480e2006f9428a9e53"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 207,
          "literal_utf8": "### HELIXLABO-L2-022 — HELIX-OS → Aggregate\n",
          "raw_sha256": "bf6e85d3ca8c576a352a6d4713f94951d9f92d314c7290b928962e29d16d227a"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 208,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 209,
          "literal_utf8": "- 親：HELIXLABO-L1-001。入力：OSから許可されたticket/運転/証拠観測。出力：source identity/revision付きobservation。依存：OS source contractと個別connector。保証：OS正本を保持し未完/unknownを区別。stale/欠落はOSへ戻す。`version_target: 1.0`。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "5a30a79f84eec6cbdd2461bab644dc5584be5e485e03c3fd1586f881ae2d09fb"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 211,
          "literal_utf8": "### HELIXLABO-L2-023 — BRAIN → Aggregate\n",
          "raw_sha256": "017f94a12e302b02ae03169b63ea97f9403d1cd6951b54c2680a67ba7df29f92"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 212,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 213,
          "literal_utf8": "- 親：HELIXLABO-L1-001。入力：許可された知識利用・適用結果の観測。出力：source版付きobservation。依存：BRAIN source contractと個別connector。保証：BRAIN知識正本を書き換えない。source identity不明はBRAINへ戻す。`version_target: 1.0`。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "4f2e1c894cd9f97808889f2b8030ad7c80acea658f2a8d189ddde1b01273ab77"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 215,
          "literal_utf8": "### HELIXLABO-L2-024 — INTELLIGENCE → Aggregate\n",
          "raw_sha256": "fe417a1ed7387336a7c5c9da5ded4839df97bb87eb31f41eb625d9f6acd5bcb6"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 216,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 217,
          "literal_utf8": "- 親：HELIXLABO-L1-001。入力：許可された判断/予測/診断/reviewの結果観測。出力：観測事実と判断結果を区別したobservation。依存：INTELLIGENCE source contractと個別connector。保証：過去評価は現在のauthorityにならない。版不一致はINTELLIGENCEへ戻す。`version_target: 1.0`。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "fe0f197869f6babd9a617d9f6ac068aeadc717c172e85eefdcb615d274e05e87"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 235,
          "literal_utf8": "### HELIXLABO-L2-029 — CI/test → Aggregate\n",
          "raw_sha256": "20bf77d0ac70333a42ecf6134293e8a336b844a5ab2ceec0e05e72645b53ae08"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 236,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 237,
          "literal_utf8": "- 親：HELIXLABO-L1-001。入力：許可されたCI/test結果と対象revision。出力：検査範囲付きobservation。依存：HARNESS verification contractとOS実行証拠。保証：未実行/stale/中断をpassとしない。検査範囲欠落はsource ownerへ戻す。`version_target: 1.0`。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "f7e27fb3d75da792020b068134ebf0e6dced1bd4e0ea0dd72fa9671300d24cee"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 255,
          "literal_utf8": "### HELIXLABO-L2-034 — LABO → BRAIN\n",
          "raw_sha256": "d798be291b34e934ffa91fa5e6f9ea379b0fdb22130dda9e963b0ce239134f84"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 256,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 257,
          "literal_utf8": "- 親：HELIXLABO-L1-007, HELIXLABO-L1-009。入力：異なるproduct/meaning/episodeを横断して支持されたgeneric structure evidence。出力：BRAIN向け構造candidate。依存：L2-009、BRAINとの個別connector。保証：product固有meaningは渡さない。一事例・適用範囲不明はL2-009へ戻す。`version_target: 1.0`（内部evidence）。外部知識の評価loopは`version_target: 2.0`。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "0bbf4cd8f0cab8cbc77ca7cf18b68890d7ccedbb27f2511887af1f958a991b73"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 259,
          "literal_utf8": "### HELIXLABO-L2-035 — LABO → INTELLIGENCE 評価材料境界\n",
          "raw_sha256": "320e50a8e9c190302b0f808a59e04b2327e4f8aa5a12024e56c154bab1d3ec14"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 260,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 261,
          "literal_utf8": "- 親：HELIXLABO-L1-007, HELIXLABO-L1-010, HELIXINTELLIGENCE-L1-018。入力：判断精度、failure corpus、counterexample、model/provider比較、FP/FN、diagnosis/review/bot評価等のLABO評価材料。HELIX-Benchの水準は専用接続L2-054で扱い、本接続のpayloadへ重複定義しない。出力：適用範囲・source revision・未評価状態付きpacketをINTELLIGENCE境界へ渡すこと。依存：評価済みevidenceとINTELLIGENCE connector。保証：この節は境界での受渡し契約を定義し、構成体の全材料収集・同一revisionの到達確認はL2-052が受け持つ。LABOは現在判断・配置・botを実行しない。未評価はそのまま渡す。`version_target: 1.0`（評価材料）。学習・調整は別の`version_target: 3.0+`。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "87c1d2239db9fa066c7aef9fff624bd2abb0b5e26cb3d2560e101792354632d0"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 413,
          "literal_utf8": "- **保証・失敗時**：未選択または未接続のsourceは未観測を保持し、成功・観測済みへ変換しない。選択sourceのversion/scope/許可/receiptが不足・不一致ならその入力の成立を拒みsource owner／SECURITYへ戻す。選択条件自体がunknownなら全部不要とせず呼出し条件の確認へ戻す。観測集積の成功をBench評価済み、割当許可、全source対応完成にしない。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "a02b05f8240164379a0542f1d232f0b74738f6d22e162bd373fadbef26bef291"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 414,
          "literal_utf8": "- **単独成立の依存**：既存HELIXLABO-L2-001の契約本文、HARNESS-L2-010／011／023の依存区分契約、選択sourceの入力接続とその安全・版条件。この追補自身を001の実行前提に再帰的に要求せず、001の利用条件を補う。実契約版は採択後に入力へ束縛し、`version_target: 1.0`を実装版・採択状態と混同しない。\n",
          "raw_sha256": "66f1d82a1db9065c7f010a13a090d69fe60903cc9604ea45e245226b8dd52c76"
        },
        {
          "path": "docs/helix-labo/L2-requirements/labo-requirements.md",
          "line": 415,
          "literal_utf8": "\n",
          "raw_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b"
        }
      ],
      "pin_revision": "f6dad2a33e24f000b87d7f09b8d40288257e74cc",
      "pinned_lines_equal_in_both_revisions": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "l11",
      "path": "docs/helix-labo/L11-acceptance/labo-acceptance.md",
